  "notes": "Python: tests/test_context_visibility.py::TestDeletedContentStaysDeleted::test_an_agent_s_turn_after_a_delete_does_not_read_the_deleted_text; tests/test_context_visibility.py::TestDeletedContentStaysDeleted::test_an_edit_s_new_content_is_still_read; tests/test_context_visibility.py::TestDeletedContentStaysDeleted::test_an_edit_of_a_deleted_event_has_its_new_content_withheld; tests/test_context_visibility.py::TestWithheldContent::test_a_delete_row_committed_outside_the_pipeline_hides_nothing. Each list expectation is exact; object expectations select the stated contract fields. Model calls prove the text history. Structural retention, raw payload removal and hook contexts are additionally covered by the specialized tests; this scenario does not claim every media or distributed path."
